OL,3,GNEWSAGCSE pass rate falls slightly as
OL,4,Atop grades edge up across England,
OL,5,AWales and Northern Ireland
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrom 11:00 BST, some pupils in England
OL,8,Fcan check their grades via an app for
OL,9,Fthe first time
OL,11,FAt one school in Derby, it's confetti,
OL,12,Fcheers and happy tears as students
OL,13,Freceive their results, while
OL,14,F16-year-old Sophie "can't believe"
OL,15,Fshe's passed her English language exam
OL,17,FStudents in Scotland have already
OL,18,Freceived their results, with the pass
OL,19,Frate up slightly on last year
